  id: ethene-hydrogenation
  title: Ethene hydrogenation
  equation: C2H4 + H2 -> C2H6
  requiredCondition: 2
  reversible: 0
  conditions: Hydrogen with palladium catalyst (Pd)
  sources:
  - https://openstax.org/books/organic-chemistry/pages/8-6-reduction-of-alkenes-hydrogenation
